    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、こんな早い時間から……\r\n今日のレッスンは、もう少し後からだと思うけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "おはようございます、プロデューサーさんっ！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今日は、いつもお世話になってる事務所に\r\nお礼がしたくてっ！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "事務所のおそうじをお手伝いしたいなって思ったんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それで、はづきさんにお話しをして、\r\n手伝わせてもらいました！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "お外をおそうじして、\r\n葉っぱとかゴミとかを集めてました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか……\r\n果穂は本当に偉いな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、ありがとうございますっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、事務所の外のおそうじ、\r\n思ったより大変で時間がかかっちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "外が終わったら、事務所の中もおそうじしたいなって\r\n思ってたんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今日は、外のおそうじしかできなそうです……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……よし！\r\nじゃあ、俺も手伝おうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いいんですかっ！？\r\nプロデューサーさんはお仕事が……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、朝一の仕事は終わらせてきたし、\r\nそれに……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "協力技だ！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂と同じ気持ちなんだ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "果穂を手伝いたい",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "協力すれば、きっとあっという間に終わるはずだぞ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "きょう・りょく・わざ……！\r\nカッコいいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ早速役割分担だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！\r\nじゃあ、あたしがホウキでもっとゴミを集めて……",
    "charAnim1": "hero",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がちりとりを固定しておこう\r\nそうすれば、丈の長いホウキでも掃きやすいだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　ありがとうございます！\r\nプロデューサーさん……お願いします！",
