  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしと……ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂にとって、この事務所は大事な場所なんだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！\r\nここは、アイドルのお仕事をするための秘密基地です！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "打ち合わせをしたり、お喋りをしたり、\r\n色んなワクワクが詰まってます！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺にとっても、ここは大事な場所なんだ\r\nだから、綺麗になってほしい気持ちは果穂と一緒だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ……それじゃあ……\r\nプロデューサーさん、一緒におそうじしちゃいましょう！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この事務所はあたしだけの基地じゃなくて、\r\nみんなの基地です！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "みんなが、アイドルのお仕事を\r\nいっぱいがんばれるように……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんと一緒に、\r\nみんなのやる気が満々になる事務所にしてみせますっ",
    "charAnim1": "hero",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020240"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂だって、いつも俺の仕事を手伝ってくれるだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020250,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "で、でも、あたしはいっつも、\r\nプロデューサーさんのお世話になってるから……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは俺も同じだよ\r\nだから、俺にも果穂の手伝いをさせてくれ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\nはい！　それじゃあ……よろしくお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし！\r\nじゃあ、決まりだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！\r\n――えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なんだか楽しそうだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020280,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんです。さっきまでおそうじをして\r\nきれいになっていくのが楽しかったのに",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900602/2009006020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006020290,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今はプロデューサーさんが一緒で、\r\nもっともっと楽しいんです！　えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
